# patchbay Licence

Copyright 2026 pyvno. All rights reserved, except as granted below.

## Free use

You may read, build, install and use patchbay, for any purpose, including at work and
at a company of any size, as long as you use it on your own: your own config file, on
your own machines.

## Team use

An organisation whose people share one list of devices through patchbay (a shared
list, set under Settings ▸ Team) needs a company licence for that use. A company
licence covers everyone in the organisation who uses that shared list.

Until company licences are offered for sale on patchbay's site, team use needs no
licence. Once they are, it needs one for every version released under these terms.

A licence covers team use in every version of patchbay for as long as it runs. When it
ends, team use ends with it until the licence is renewed. Free use is not affected.

## What you may not do

Sell, rent or redistribute patchbay or a modified version of it, remove or work around
the licence check in a copy you give to anyone else, or build a competing product from
its source.

## No warranty

patchbay is provided as it is, without any warranty. As far as the law allows, we
are not liable for any damages arising from its use.

Versions 0.1.58 and earlier were released under the PolyForm Perimeter License 1.0.1
and stay under it for anyone who has a copy.
